      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Atom probe tomography, synchrotron X-ray scattering, and high-resolution electron microscopy can establish the degree of SRO and distinguish it from precipitation or long-range order.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Incipient precipitation or other microstructural evolution could confound the relationship between SRO and mechanical properties.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
